  "title": "Neerie NDE 7092",
  "date": "'February 10, 2012'",
  "content": "I was in a park, but it was very old and abandoned. The only thing there was a metal swing set. There was lots of vegetation, and there were plants growing everywhere. It was super sunny and the whole scene was bathed in sunlight. The main colors were green and yellow and it was safe, warm, and comfortable. There was a guy there, around my age, with brown hair, and we were swinging. I remember it as being the best feeling in the world. Just total bliss! I started to walk down a dark tunnel, but it wasn't scary, it, too, was warm and cozy. I heard my mom calling my name. The last thing I saw was when I turned around to look at the beginning of the tunnel, from where the light from the park was coming. I felt very, very upset that I was gone, and in fact, was about to complain to my mom that she had taken me away from there. Then I saw her face and realized something was very wrong. That, of course, was the fact that I was unconscious.",
